      "label": "Black man in suit and glasses",
      "description": "Central figure, bald, wearing glasses and a dark suit with a blue tie, laughing broadly with an open mouth. His expression is one of apparent amusement or triumph, and he is the focal point of the image. The text overlay attributes a racially charged statement to him, implying he is representing or speaking for a group.",
