      "instance_name": "racially_charged_statement_scene",
      "label": "A scene depicting a man making a racially charged statement",
      "description": "The central figure, man_in_foreground, is shown laughing broadly while overlaid text attributes a hateful statement to him. The text accuses South Africans of being complicit in or tolerant of theft by outsiders, using a dehumanizing and economically reductive stereotype. The scene is framed to emphasize the man's expression of amusement or triumph as he is portrayed as delivering this harmful message.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
